## English Summary

You are free to study, fork, install, modify, and build upon this project for **non-commercial** purposes.

**Attribution is required.** Any fork or derivative work must clearly credit the original project and link back to
<https://github.com/BaYue-SYJ/shuixian-image-reverse>. You may not remove, obscure, or weaken the original
attribution, and you may not present the work as your own.

**Commercial use requires prior written permission** from the author. Contact via the WeChat Official Account
「水仙的AI提示词」or by opening an issue in this repository.

Reference images under `assets/` remain the property of their respective original authors; this project only uses
them to demonstrate the method and makes no claim over that content. Generated images are AI model outputs, not
photographs, and do not represent any brand, person or institution. Trademarks and likenesses appearing in those
images belong to their owners and are not licensed by this repository.
